great either...","nextNodeIds":[240150403]},{"nodeId":240150403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":484039434,"text":"Ugh! Just a few elements removed, and the whole thing's a mess now!","nextNodeIds":[240150404,240150405]},{"nodeId":240150404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":535935626,"text":"What are you up to?","nextNodeIds":[240150406]},{"nodeId":240150406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":2202004338,"text":"Ah, it's you. It's good to see you again...","nextNodeIds":[240150407]},{"nodeId":240150407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":3060618330,"text":"I apologize for the misunderstanding — I was merely thinking about the issues with this picture, and I couldn't help but pace about...","nextNodeIds":[240150408]},{"nodeId":240150408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1023068058,"text":"You might not be able to understand, but I simply cannot sit still when reflecting on problems.","nextNodeIds":[240150409]},{"nodeId":240150409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":4268525434,"text":"The longer I sit in place considering problems, the more frustrated I get. That's why I'm used to thinking as I pace.","nextNodeIds":[240150410]},{"nodeId":240150410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1646210506,"text":"I allow my legs to carry me anywhere they will as I think, so long as they don't keep me in place.","nextNodeIds":[240150411]},{"nodeId":240150411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":3162508082,"text":"So... this happens often. Sorry for making you worry.","nextNodeIds":[240150412,240150413]},{"nodeId":240150412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2747273634,"text":"So, did you reach a conclusion, then?","nextNodeIds":[240150414]},{"nodeId":240150414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":4164663018,"text":"No progress, I fear... I just don't know where to begin.","nextNodeIds":[240150415]},{"nodeId":240150415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1977320210,"text":"If I remove the lighting effects, the image lacks layers, but if I reduce contour and shaping, the objects within the picture cannot sustain its structure.","nextNodeIds":[240150416]},{"nodeId":240150416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1944736586,"text":"The removal of just any few elements will send the whole edifice crashing down, devolving it into a heap of trash.","nextNodeIds":[240150417]},{"nodeId":240150417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":501211026,"text":"I'm just talking to myself, by the way, so don't worry too much — I'm just thinking about how to solve this problem.","nextNodeIds":[240150418]},{"nodeId":240150418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":2645731522,"text":"I must go back and look for my easel first...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":240150413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":347778234,"text":"And what of the question you were considering?","nextNodeIds":[240150414]},{"nodeId":240150405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2895595338,"text":"I almost thought you were in danger or something.","nextNodeIds":[240150406]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2401504,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133403169"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL"