t":"Seriously, I was just painting over here — but before I knew it, they had me surrounded!","nextNodeIds":[240150603]},{"nodeId":240150603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":2505912794,"text":"They attacked my painting so vigorously, you'd think they wanted to eat it or something!","nextNodeIds":[240150604]},{"nodeId":240150604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":825193874,"text":"But I couldn't let them have it, of course, so I grabbed it and ran...","nextNodeIds":[240150605]},{"nodeId":240150605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":118495250,"text":"Didn't get far before they caught up, though — thank the Archons you were there to rescue me.","nextNodeIds":[240150606,240150607]},{"nodeId":240150606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1577076738,"text":"Is there something wrong with this painting?","nextNodeIds":[240150608]},{"nodeId":240150608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1169474410,"text":"A—Archons if I know! I've always used Whopperflower Nectar to make my paints — you know, the stuff you got for me previously?","nextNodeIds":[240150609]},{"nodeId":240150609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1503028578,"text":"Wait... What if the paint was attracting them? No, that can't be — that nectar doesn't smell at all after I mix it into the paint!","nextNodeIds":[240150610]},{"nodeId":240150610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":215404890,"text":"I daren't change the paint formula on the fly, either. Guess we'll have to find some other way...","nextNodeIds":[240150611]},{"nodeId":240150611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","textMapHash":1757847962,"text":"*cough* And here I thought that even the Whopperflowers could sense the beauty in my painting and wanted to come have a look at it.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":240150607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1401496978,"text":"What did you do?","nextNodeIds":[240150608]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2401506,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133403279"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["43060"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_DAILY_TASK"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5140"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[2401504,2401506],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5140,"speakerName":"Depierris","count":23},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":true,"CBBBCAKOFGO":1769820070,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"5140":[4190,1260]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":